ation of ChatGPT on the Plastic Surgery In-Service Examination. Aesthetic Surgery Journal\\n[b15] Di Jin; Eileen Pan; Nassim Oufattole; Wei-Hung Weng; Hanyi Fang; Peter Szolovits (2020-09). What Disease does this Patient Have? A Large-scale Open Domain Question Answering Dataset from Medical Exams. \\n[b16] Qiao Jin; Bhuwan Dhingra; Zhengping Liu; William Cohen; Xinghua Lu (2019-11). PubMedQA: A Dataset for Biomedical Research Question Answering. \\n[b17] Hyunjae Kim; Hyeon Hwang; Jiwoo Lee; Sihyeon Park; Dain Kim; Taewhoo Lee; Chanwoong Yoon; Jiwoong Sohn; Donghee Choi; Jaewoo Kang (2024-03). Small Language Models Learn Enhanced Reasoning Skills from Medical Textbooks. \\n[b18] Mason Marks; Claudia E Haupt (2023-07). AI Chatbots, Health Privacy, and Challenges to HIPAA Compliance. JAMA\\n[b19] Andrew Mihalache; Marko M Popovic; Rajeev H Muni (2023-06). Performance of an Artificial Intelligence Chatbot in Ophthalmic Knowledge Assessment. JAMA Ophthalmology\\n[b20]  Mistral (2024). Models | Mistral AI Large Language Models. \\n[b21] Akhila Narla; Brett Kuprel; Kavita Sarin; Roberto Novoa; Justin Ko (2018-10). Automated Classification of Skin Lesions: From Pixels to Practice. Journal of Investigative Dermatology\\n[b22]  Nbems;  Neet (2024-05). . \\n[b23] Harsha Nori; Nicholas King; Scott Mayer Mckinney; Dean Carignan; Eric Horvitz (2023-04). Capabilities of GPT-4 on Medical Challenge Problems. \\n[b24]  Openai (2023-03). . \\n[b25]  Openai (2024). Hello GPT-4o. \\n[b26] Ankit Pal; Logesh Kumar Umapathi; Malaikannan Sankarasubbu (2022-04). MedMCQA: A Large-scale Multi-Subject Multi-Choice Dataset for Medical domain Question Answering. PMLR\\n[b27] Ankit Pal; Pasquale Minervini; Andreas Geert Motzfeldt; Beatrice Alex (2024). openlifescienceai/open medical llm leaderboard. \\n[b28] Sarah Prediger; Kristina Schick; Fabian Fincke; Sophie Fürstenberg; Viktor Oubaid; Martina Kadmon; Pascal O Berberat; Sigrid Harendza (2020-01). Validation of a competence-based assessment of