ion processing along the visual pathway. Elife\\n[b66] H Pierre-Étienne;  Fiquet; P Eero;  Simoncelli (2023). A polar prediction model for learning to represent visual transformations. \\n[b67] A Bruno; David J Olshausen;  Field (2004). Sparse coding of sensory inputs. Current opinion in neurobiology\\n[b68] E William; Jack L Vinje;  Gallant (2000). Sparse coding and decorrelation in primary visual cortex during natural vision. Science\\n[b69] L Alison; James Fa Poulet Barth (2012). Experimental evidence for sparse firing in the neocortex. Trends in neurosciences\\n[b70] Quiroga Quian (2008). Sparse but not \\'grandmother-cell\\'coding in the medial temporal lobe. Trends in cognitive sciences\\n[b71] Tomáš Hromádka (2008). Sparse representation of sounds in the unanesthetized auditory cortex. PLoS biology\\n[b72] Cindy Poo; Jeffry S Isaacson (2009). Odor representations in olfactory cortex: \"sparse\" coding, global inhibition, and oscillations. Neuron\\n[b73] Jason Wolfe (2010). Sparse and powerful cortical spikes. Current opinion in neurobiology\\n[b74]  Ben Db Willmore (2011). Sparse coding in striate and extrastriate visual cortex. Journal of neurophysiology\\n[b75] Bilal Haider (2010). Synaptic and network mechanisms of sparse and reliable visual cortical activity during nonclassical receptive field stimulation. Neuron\\n[b76] Sylvain Crochet (2011). Synaptic mechanisms underlying sparse coding of active touch. Neuron\\n[b77] C H Carl;  Petersen (2019). Sensorimotor processing in the rodent barrel cortex. Nature Reviews Neuroscience\\n[b78] Emmanouil Froudarakis (2014). Population code in mouse V1 facilitates readout of natural scenes through increased sparseness. Nature neuroscience\\n[b79] J Christopher;  Rozell (2008). Sparse coding via thresholding and local competition in neural circuits. Neural Computation\\n[b80] I Daubechies (2004). An iterative thresholding algorithm for linear inverse problems with a sparsity constraint. Communications on Pure and App